<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6295"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bestbud<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bestbud<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 8:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Oh!  Sorry...Didn&#39;t know I wasn&#39;t supposed to copy and paste info.  Thanks for the heads up! ;&#41; <BR> <BR>Did you check out the White Van with the &#34;Unidentifed&#34; Logo? Hmmmm.... <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
